+ * Etesian toolbar API (com.bompotis.etesian.toolbar.EtesianToolbar) is in front, that app's own
+ * items in their place (with Back only if the app asks for it). Back sits on the left or the
+ * right; the bar is light grey (N9) or dark (Symbian Belle).
